-----------------------------------------------------------------------
	   OSACombat Version: 4.2.50 (August 22, 2026)
	
	   Usage:
	   
       osacombat setup                       Opens the setup window to configure combat routines
       osacombat help                        Opens the help window (This window).
       osacombat ?                           Opens the help window (This window).
	   
       * Note: All commands can be initiated while the script is running. (Do not use semi-colon for commands while running OSACombat)
	   
       OSACombat is an automated combat script.
       Enjoy 
		
       ~Peggyanne 
       
	   PS: feel free to send me any bugs via discord Bait#4376 and I'll try my best to fix them.
	 
	 Change Log:
	 
            April 11, 2026 - Fixed Targetting Issues Temporarily Until Rewrite Using More Sound Logic.
            April 19, 2026 - More Targetting Issues Resolved.
              May 16, 2026 - Fixed spell 610 room effect guard false-matching decorative room objects. Added Opener Spell slots (3 per tab). Added Skip/Exclusive Opener 
                             fields to Creature Exceptions. Added first-run migration prompt. Removed obsolete check_for_badstuff and related logic.
              May 17, 2026 - Added check_dependencies at startup for all required suite scripts with correct authors.
              May 18, 2026 - Fixed GUI crash: get_val lambda now uses @combat_data directly.
              May 19, 2026 - Fixed groupeffects first-cast buffs firing only on enemy ship; now checks live NPC presence. All first-cast flags start false unconditionally. 
                             Fixed cast_spell_rapid_fire setting first-cast flag before confirming spell was castable.
              May 20, 2026 - Fixed cast_spell_society never setting $society_firstcast; signs/sigils/symbols now correctly flip to refresh-only path after first cast.
              May 20, 2026 - Looter now only runs when zero living hostile mobs remain in the room.
              May 22, 2026 - Applied mana_share_cooldown rate limiting to combat_spellup; buff casting now uses the same cooldown guard as can_cast_spell to prevent channel spam. 
                             Added Mana Request Cooldown field to General tab (default 90s).
              May 23, 2026 - Added Spell Sever tab with four spell number fields (sever_spell_1 through sever_spell_4).
              May 24, 2026 - Fixed targeting race conditions causing missed first encounters and mid-combat stalls. Targeting
                             responsibility moved out of load_attack_vars into get_target. get_target now called explicitly
                             before load_attack_vars in main loop and at top of combat. load_attack_vars returns early if
                             target is nil rather than blocking. Living/undead var switching still occurs each call.
              May 27, 2026 - Improved anti-poaching logic to prevent false positives causing combat stalls when hunting with
                             a companion. Disk check now cross-references Group.members by noun to forgive disks whose XML
                             hasn't caught up yet. Claim check uses a 3-strike counter to tolerate brief XML lag on room
                             entry. Added Claim::Lock wait to ensure claim state is fully settled before reading.
              May 31, 2026 - Added "Cast Buffs Without Waiting For Enemy" checkbox to Support tab. When enabled, all support
                             buff first-cast flags are pre-flipped at startup so buffs cast immediately rather than waiting
                             for a live enemy to be present first.
              June 9, 2026 - Added "Wait For Room Clear Before Looting" checkbox to General tab. Defaults to checked to
                             preserve existing behavior. Uncheck to allow eloot to run while enemies are still present.
             June 27, 2026 - Added exhale green mist disease trigger to downstream hook; creature variant using "exhales a
                             virulent green mist toward you, instantly infecting you" now correctly sets diseased status.
                             Reordered health_monitor to check poison then disease before injuries so status conditions
                             are prioritized and reported correctly before wound-level checks.
              July 2, 2026 - Added stranger PC presence check to check_for_poaching; non-group PCs in the room now
                             immediately set $poaching = true regardless of claim state, preventing attacks on mobs
                             that strangers may not have tagged yet. group_nouns reused across PC and disk checks.
              July 3, 2026 - Fixed check_for_injuries overwriting $osa_healing_status when disease or poison was set
                             by the downstream hook before the injury check ran. check_for_injuries now returns early
                             if status is already "diseased" or "poisoned" preserving the higher-priority condition.
              July 4, 2026 - Fixed check_for_disease not triggering from downstream hook flag when character is stunned;
                             added $osa_healing_status == "diseased" trigger alongside diseased? and made the clearance
                             guard stun-aware. Added $osa_status_burst flag set in the downstream hook and check_for_poison
                             when disease or poison is first detected; check_for_injuries only skips during the same burst
                             window so injury is reported normally on subsequent cycles when also diseased or poisoned.
            August 2, 2026 - Replaced five quiet_command "spell active" calls with pause 0.3; end pattern never matched when
                             debuffs were active causing full timeout suppression. Fixed energy_shield quiet_command end pattern.
                             Added lnet_crew broadcast to downstream hook disease detection and check_for_disease so crew is
                             notified immediately when diseased. Added unaffected guard to disease hook so resisted attacks do
                             not trigger false broadcast. Replaced infuse_shield with infuse_gear; downstream hook captures item
                             noun from "Your <item> returns to normal." into $osa_expired_gear array; infuse_gear re-casts 1604
                             on each expired noun each combat cycle. before_dying calls infuse_gear as failsafe. Re-added
                             sanctuary room 35764 check at top of main loop which had been written out during iteration.
            August 3, 2026 - Added Group Spell Shield (219) to Support tab between Group Heroism (215) and Sanctify Right Hand
                             (330); cast via EVOKE, gated on Spell[219].known?, group present, and Spell Shield cooldown not
                             active. Requires 50 ranks of Spiritual Lore, Blessings for group version. Re-added Beseech Ignite
                             and Beseech Conserve checkboxes to General tab alongside Paladin Infuse Spell; after girding,
                             beseeches the right hand weapon with the selected variant if the corresponding buff is not active.
          August 22, 2026 - Major overhaul of Living and Undead tabs. Replaced fixed 10-slot attack/spell system with a
                             dynamic array-based routine (living_routine / undead_routine in YAML). Each entry carries full
                             per-entry conditions: stance override, mana/stamina/target count gates, all target state flags,
                             creature exceptions (Only Use On / Do Not Use On), per-entry flare gloves and wing pin adj+noun,
                             kneel/stealth (attacks), cast type/open cast/Tremors 909 radio (spells). General tab cleaned up:
                             replaced dual UAC checkboxes with Use Gird and Store and Use UAC; removed redundant kneeling,
                             stealth, stomp/tap/pound, flare gloves and energy wing pin fields. Support tab reorganized:
                             Society then Buffs (Energy Wings rows added after Steely Resolve) then Support Options (renamed
                             from Buff Options; added Enable Unstun, Bless Caster, Need Bless, Symbol of Restore Threshold,
                             Light/Dark Wings Pin adj+noun fields). Creature Exceptions tab removed; per-entry exceptions and
                             tab-level Creature Exclusion List and Target Priority fields added to Living and Undead tabs.
                             Anti-poaching fixed: GameObj.pcs.to_a nil guard prevents false poach on empty rooms; own disk
                             excluded from stranger disk check; solo hunters bypass claim check; check_for_poaching called
                             unconditionally each main loop cycle so group joins clear $poaching immediately.
=end

